  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar National Community Driven Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to enable poor rural communities to benefit from improved access to and use of basic infrastructure and services through a people-centered approach and to enhance the government&#x2019;s capacity to respond promptly and effectively to an eligible crisis or emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
